    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "visible": true,
      "body": "I'm a mobile engineer with 13 years in Kotlin and Flutter, across consumer apps, healthcare, IoT, hospitality and e-commerce. At RD Labs (USA) I was promoted to Team Lead within six months and led mobile delivery for a platform with more than 3 million active users.\n\nI care about results a business can measure: retention, conversion, stability. I also work AI-native. Coding agents are part of my daily workflow, and I built an open-source toolkit that keeps their output inside the architecture, testing and security rules a production app needs."
    },
